DIY-telescope-focuser - Licensing

The indi-gpio_drv8833_focus submodule contains the focuser software.
Its applicable licences, copyright notices and complete licence
texts are provided in indi-gpio_drv8833_focus/LICENSE.

https://github.com/dom128/indi-gpio_drv8833_focus/blob/main/LICENSE


The hardware fabrication (PCB design) files in the fabrication/ directory
are licensed separately from the repository's own material.
See fabrication/LICENSE and
fabrication/NOTICE.txt for the applicable licence
grant, third-party terms and attribution.

Online:
